  {
    "command": "set_background",
    "display_name": "下駄箱",
    "id": "35",
    "timezone": "2"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「やぁ、酷い雨だね――少年」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「唐突ですまないけれど、タオルかハンカチでも持っていないかい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「本を読みながら歩いていたら雨が降っていることに気づかず、ずぶ濡れになってしまってね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「制服などはどうでもいいのだけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「本が濡れてインクがにじんで、判読できなくなってしまったのが哀しいよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「それでも筋が追えるならばいいのだけど、どうにも読めない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「古典はいけないね、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「じぃっと集中しなければただの文字の羅列になってしまって、内容がわからなくなってしまう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「暗闇のなかに迷いこんでしまったようだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ふむ、ありがとう。髪が濡れて重たいなぁ、前髪が邪魔で文字が追えない――」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ふう、この本は新しく買い直すか。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「しかし困った、鞄のなかまでズブ濡れだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「持参していた本が全滅してしまったよ、乾かせば元通りになるかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「無理して読もうとすると、ページが破れてしまいそうだよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「君、何か読めるものをもっていないかい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「教科書は全学年のものを読んでしまったから、それ以外がいいな。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「活字なら、もう辞書でもいいよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「二宮金次郎というわけでもないが、どうにも私は貧乏性でね、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「歩いている時間ももったいないと思ってしまうのだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「人生のすべての時間を費やしても、世の中にある本のすべてを読めやしないのだけど――」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ふむ？　下駄箱のなかに見知らぬ本が入っていた？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「いいね、ドラマチックじゃないか――物語的だよ、少年。それ、読ませてくれないか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「…………」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「これは、えっちな本ではないか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「君、草食系って顔してるものね、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「誰かがそんな君に活をいれたくて下駄箱にエロ本を仕込んだのかな――」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「などと、行間を読んでみるが」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「ふむ、これはこれでなかなか興味深い。借りてもいいかな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「む？　これを読みながら歩くのはよくない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「なぜだ、文章に貴賤はないよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「……おや、そろそろ予鈴が鳴るね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「手間取らせてすまない、いろいろ助かったよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「では、さらばだ少年――これ、読み終わったら返すよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「え？　いらない？　君は欲がないね。いや、ほんとに面白いぞこれ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 58,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "しおん",
    "text": "「読まないの？　ふぅん……」"
  }
]